{
 "_note": [
  "Placed gameplay actors per map, read from the cooked World Partition cell packages (Content/Maps/Worlds/<World>/<World>/_Generated_ and the GameFeatures external data layer cells for the same world), round 66. Static analysis only; the game was not run.",
  "scope play = bounding box of the zone-region polygons plus 500 m (the round 65 scope); Saburtulo has no region list so only world exists. scope world = the whole world package (shared with other maps: Mindori and Tevza use the Bakurani world, Berlin and Paris the Ozeti world). jutari_zone_area = 850 m box around the Sniper Showdown zone object in the Bakurani world.",
  "Positions: root component RelativeLocation of the placed actor (world coordinates, cm). Child actors (single doors, windows) take the position of the parent building actor they hang on. Classes in group art are listed for completeness and are not interactive.",
  "other_buckets are actors in game-feature cells of PvE scenarios, the shooting range and tutorial, and Sniper Showdown; they are not part of the main map and are not in the play or world totals.",
  "Spawn data (vehicle yards, boards, infantry spawn spots per area) is in vehicle-spawns.json (round 51) and is not repeated here."
 ],
